From: Sangbaek Park <sangbaekpark@chromium.org>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 13:58:29 -0700
Subject: media: Fix UAF when MojoCdm is destroyed during OnConnectionError

When a remote CDM connection error occurs, MojoCdm::OnConnectionError()
rejects all pending promises and calls
CdmSessionTracker::CloseRemainingSessions() by passing a reference to
its `session_closed_cb_` member.

Running `session_closed_cb_` (or rejecting a pending promise) can
synchronously release the last reference to `MojoCdm` (for example,
when `MediaKeySession::OnSessionClosed()` disposes its session and drops
the last reference to `CdmSessionAdapter`). If `MojoCdm` is destroyed
mid-loop while multiple sessions are being closed, subsequent iterations
in `CdmSessionTracker::CloseRemainingSessions()` dereference the freed
`MojoCdm::session_closed_cb_`.

Fix this by holding a `scoped_refptr<MojoCdm>` on the stack in
`MojoCdm::OnConnectionError()`, so `MojoCdm` stays alive until the
method returns.

Bug: 573938968
Change-Id: I57a976035d2818ac621ee9bb7f7ab77a950f5ece
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8593547
Reviewed-by: Colin Blundell <blundell@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Sangbaek Park <sangbaekpark@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1722311}
(cherry picked from commit 8b782807c92e9c9ef01d869adac351db43dd1612)

diff --git a/media/mojo/clients/mojo_cdm.cc b/media/mojo/clients/mojo_cdm.cc
index b454815669f476e387a9bc5e3a1c3f5aeb2d974a..3bfbf574b78383f9b0cded83b2133c8bcd537b58 100644
--- a/media/mojo/clients/mojo_cdm.cc
+++ b/media/mojo/clients/mojo_cdm.cc
@@ -123,6 +123,11 @@ void MojoCdm::OnConnectionError(uint32_t custom_reason,
 
   remote_cdm_.reset();
 
+  // Keep `this` alive in case rejecting a promise or closing a session drops
+  // what would otherwise be the last reference to `this` while in the middle
+  // of looping through the remaining promises/sessions.
+  scoped_refptr<MojoCdm> self(this);
+
   // As communication with the remote CDM is broken, reject any outstanding
   // promises and close all the existing sessions.
   cdm_promise_adapter_.Clear(CdmPromiseAdapter::ClearReason::kConnectionError);
diff --git a/media/mojo/clients/mojo_cdm_unittest.cc b/media/mojo/clients/mojo_cdm_unittest.cc
index d3b898d3223679789a83497b4ebbe9ec253a8c9b..efae1b148e2f17292a8667154a70e6c7716e0ae1 100644
--- a/media/mojo/clients/mojo_cdm_unittest.cc
+++ b/media/mojo/clients/mojo_cdm_unittest.cc
@@ -633,6 +633,21 @@ TEST_F(MojoCdmTest, SessionKeysChangeCB_Success) {
   base::RunLoop().RunUntilIdle();
 }
 
+TEST_F(MojoCdmTest, ConnectionError_DestroyCdmInSessionClosedCB) {
+  const std::string session_id_1 = "session1";
+  const std::string session_id_2 = "session2";
+  Initialize(SUCCESS);
+  CreateSessionAndExpect(session_id_1, SUCCESS);
+  CreateSessionAndExpect(session_id_2, SUCCESS);
+
+  EXPECT_CALL(cdm_client_,
+              OnSessionClosed(_, CdmSessionClosedReason::kInternalError))
+      .WillOnce(WithoutArgs([this]() { mojo_cdm_.reset(); }))
+      .WillOnce(Return());
+
+  ForceConnectionError();
+}
